OL,3,GNEWSARail bridge tops 'Britain's most
OL,4,Abashed' list again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway bridge in Leicestershire that
OL,7,Fwas recently hit twice in two days has
OL,8,Fretained the dubious honour as
OL,9,FBritain's most bashed bridge.
OL,11,FOn Sunday, Network Rail said the A5
OL,12,FWatling Street bridge in Hinckley had
OL,13,Ftopped its 2025-26 list, with 26
OL,14,Fstrikes between 1 April 2025 and 31
OL,15,FMarch. A further 13 have been reported
OL,16,Fup to August.
OL,18,FCampaigners have been pushing for
OL,19,Fmeasures to end disruption caused by
OL,20,Fthe crashes, including lowering the
OL,21,Froad under the bridge, but Network Rail
OL,22,Fis yet to sign off the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
