OL,3,GNEWSARail bridge tops 'Britain's most
OL,4,Abashed' list again
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail said 1,706 bridge strikes
OL,7,Fwere recorded in 2025-26, causing
OL,8,F185,319 minutes of delays and costing
OL,9,Fabout #13.25m in delays, cancellations
OL,10,Fand repairs.
